     "description": "Operating both within China and across international markets, Zhongji Innolight Co., Ltd. conducts comprehensive activities including the research, design, development, production, and sale of advanced intelligent equipment. A core part of its product portfolio comprises specialized motor stator coil winding machinery, which is vital for manufacturing motors utilized in diverse applications such as domestic electrical appliances, various small to medium-sized industrial motors, vehicle alternators, and the propulsion units for new energy automobiles. Furthermore, the company furnishes optical communication transceiver modules to clients in critical sectors like data centers, data transmission, long-haul telecommunications, and wireless network infrastructure. Founded in 1987, the enterprise was formerly known as Shandong Zhongji Electrical Equipment Co., Ltd. until its official rebranding to Zhongji Innolight Co., Ltd. in September 2017. Its main operational base is situated in Longkou, China.",
